{'symbol': 'DAL', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00', 'title': 'DELTA SAYS TYPHOON HAGIBIS TO MAKE LANDFALL IN TOKYO SATURDAY, SOME FLIGHTS CANCELLED', 'text': 'OCT 11  - DELTA AIR LINES INC <DAL.N>::DELTA AIR LINES INC - TYPHOON HAGIBIS TO MAKE LANDFALL IN TOKYO SATURDAY, SOME FLIGHTS CANCELLED.DELTA AIR LINES - CANCELLED 18 MAINLINE FLIGHTS FOR KANSAI, NAGOYA, TOKYO-HANEDA AND TOKYO-NARITA AIRPORTS ON FRIDAY, SATURDAY DUE TO TYPHOON HAGIBIS.'}